invitation.set.password = Choose a password to sign in to WLX Jury. Your email address is your login.
invitation.replaces.password = Choose a new password. It replaces the old password of this account, and signs out every other session of it.
invitation.submit = Set password and sign in
new.password = New password
current.password = Current password
current.password.explain = Needed to change your password or your email address.
passwords.differ = The passwords do not match.
password.current.wrong = The current password is not correct.
password.others.not.allowed = This account''s password can''t be set: it has been deleted, or it is not a member of this contest.
password.set.by.admin = Set password
password.set.by.admin.help = Leave blank to keep the current password. A new one signs the person out everywhere, and their email must be verified again. Give it to them in person.
password.set.by.admin.done = Password set. The person is signed out everywhere, and their email must be verified again.
password.set.email.separately = Change the email and set the password in separate saves.
password.set.role.separately = Change the role and set the password in separate saves.
password.set.no.login = No password can be set for this account: it has no email address, so it signs in with Wikimedia, or it has nothing to sign in with.
password.set.others.saved = Your other changes were saved; the password was not set.
email.change.title = New email address
email.change.confirm = Make {0} the email address of your WLX Jury account?
email.change.confirm.button = Confirm the new email address
email.change.done = Your email address is now {0}. Sign in with it.
email.change.explain = A new address takes effect once you follow the link sent to it.
email.change.sent = A confirmation link has been sent to the new email address. It takes effect once the link is followed.
email.change.subject = Confirm your new email address for WLX Jury
email.change.body = Hello,\n\nOn your profile page in WLX Jury ({2}), the jury tool of the Wiki Loves photo contests, you asked to make this address the email address of your account.\n\nFollow this link within {1} hours to confirm it:\n{0}\n\nIf you did not ask for this, ignore this message: your account keeps its current address.
setup.title = Set up WLX Jury
setup.explain = Create the first account, the administrator (root), with the setup token from the server configuration.
setup.token = Setup token
setup.submit = Create the account
setup.token.invalid = The setup token is not correct.
invitation.subject = Invitation to the {0} jury
invitation.body = Hello,\n\n{1} invites you to the jury of {0}.\nFollow this link within {3} days to set your password and sign in:\n{2}\n\nYour email address is your login.
invitation.subject.tool = Invitation to WLX Jury
invitation.body.tool = Hello,\n\n{2} invites you to WLX Jury, the jury tool of the Wiki Loves photo contests.\nFollow this link within {1} days to set your password and sign in:\n{0}\n\nYour email address is your login.
invitation.link = Follow this link within {1} days to set your password and sign in:\n{0}
password.link.subject = Set a new password for WLX Jury
password.link.body = Hello,\n\nFollow this link within {1} days to set a new password for WLX Jury:\n{0}\n\nYour current password works until then. If you did not expect this, ignore this message.
password.link.sent = A link to set a new password has been sent to the account. The current password works until it is used.
password.link.not.sent = The link could not be sent. Try again later.
password.link.no.email = The account has no email address, so no link can be sent.
wiki.account.invalid = This is not a valid wiki user name.
wiki.account.taken = Another account already has this wiki account.
wiki.account.own.readonly = Your wiki account cannot be changed here yet; ask your contest admin.
wiki.account.unverified.hint = Not verified: anyone could have entered this wiki account.
email.unverified.hint = No invitation or link sent to this address has been used yet. To give this account a new role, send an invitation.
email.unverified.own.hint = Your email isn''t confirmed yet: ask your contest admin to send you an invitation by email.
unverified = unverified
role.needs.invitation.email = This account has not verified its email, and has none to invite: the role cannot be given.
invitation.send = Send the invitation again
invitation.sent = An invitation has been sent. The role applies once it is accepted.
invitation.not.sent = The invitation could not be sent. Try again later.
invitation.not.possible = No invitation can be sent to this account.
invitations.pending = Invitations not accepted yet
invitation.expires = Expires
users.invited = Invited (role given once they accept): {0}.
