invitation.set.password.wiki = Choose a password to sign in to WLX Jury. Your wiki account, {0}, is your login.
invitations.recent = Invitations
share.link.create = Create a link to share
share.link.title = A link to set the password
share.link.for = For: {0}
share.link.invitation.help = Copy this link and send it to the person yourself. It sets the password of the account, once, and signs them in; the role applies then.
share.link.reset.help = Copy this link and send it to the person yourself. It sets a new password for the account, once, and signs out every other session of it. The current password works until then.
share.link.reset.explain = A link that sets a new password, for you to send to the person yourself instead of by email. Creating one makes the previous unused links stop working.
share.link.expires = Expires {0}.
share.link.warning = Anyone with this link can set this account''s password: send it only to the person, privately.
share.link.once = This link is shown only now. Reloading or resubmitting this page creates a new link, and this one stops working; so does any new link, by email or to share. Creating it has stopped the account''s earlier unused links of the same kind, mailed ones included (root''s password reset too).
share.link.copy = Copy
share.link.copied = Copied
share.link.back = Back
share.link.no.login = The account has neither an email address nor a wiki account to sign in with, so no link can be created.
share.link.wikimedia = The account has no email address: the person signs in with Wikimedia, with their wiki account, so no password link is created for it.
share.link.wikimedia.note = Signs in with Wikimedia, as {0}
